.Cm hpn-check-file@hpnssh.org
extension
.Pq capital Fl V ; lowercase Fl v No is verbose .
A mismatch is logged, recorded, and reported in a summary when the session
ends, after which
.Nm
exits with code 57
.Pq Dv SFTP_EX_VERIFY_FAILED ;
the transfer itself is not aborted.
This requires the remote server to advertise
